      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the \"small steps\" thing isn't working though. it's not just a bad month, it's like my whole life is just this loop of suffering and failing. it feels like i'm just dragging this around for no reason. like, if the end result is always back at zero, what's the point of all the effort? it just feels like a waste of time to keep struggling.",
